@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
title Анализ сессии – основной поток и отдельный пересчёт
participant "demo : Program" as demo
participant "service : AnalysisService" as service
participant "timeline : ActivityReconstructor" as timeline
participant "classifier : PolicyResourceClassifier" as classifier
participant "detector : ViolationDetector" as detector
participant "rule : ExceedsLimitSpecification" as rule
participant "store : InMemoryAnalysisRunStore" as store
demo -> service : Analyze(session, policy, until, devices, events, options)
service -> timeline : Reconstruct(...)
activate timeline
timeline -> timeline : Validate; deduplicate; sort; build boundaries
loop Каждый элементарный интервал
  timeline -> timeline : Apply events; select break or device
  opt Есть подтверждённая активность
    timeline -> classifier : Classify(resource, policy)
    classifier --> timeline : category
  end
  timeline -> timeline : Merge adjacent equal categories
end
timeline --> service : read-only intervals
deactivate timeline
service -> detector : Detect(intervals, policy)
loop Интервал Idle / NonTarget / Lunch
  detector -> rule : IsSatisfiedBy(duration, limit)
  rule --> detector : duration > limit
end
detector --> service : read-only violations
service -> service : Create AnalysisRun(new id, version, options)
service -> store : Append(run)
store --> service : saved in memory
service --> demo : AnalysisRun
note over demo,store
После позднего события вызывается новый Analyze.
Новый run добавляется; старый не изменяется.
Автоматического фонового пересчёта в ЛР8 нет.
end note
@enduml
